      "note": [
        "For more information about the statistics and revisions, see further [Documentation (in Swedish)](https://www.scb.se/contentassets/f0d9c7eda5be4b8a96c5827e4bebf513/mi1301_kd_2024_261015.pdf) and the [Statistical News Release](https://www.scb.se/en/finding-statistics/statistics-by-subject-area/environment/environmental-accounts-and-sustainable-development/system-of-environmental-and-economic-accounts/pong/statistical-news/environmental-pressure-from-consumption-2024/).",
        "Country of origin: shows the country in which the production-based emissions resulting from Swedish consumption occur.",
        "Product group: shows the greenhouse gas emissions generated throughout the entire value chain (e.g. emissions associated with intermediate goods and services) for a specific product group to meet final demand.",
        "The entire time series for the statistics on environmental pressures from consumption is updated at each annual publication. For this release, revisions have been made to the underlying data, resulting in differences compared with previously published values."
